audience.description:
Target audience. Omit it, or send `daytona:api`, for a project-scoped token;
send `daytona:analytics` for an organization-scoped token. Any other
value is refused; the parameter may not be repeated.

disk_mib.description:
The disk size in MiB that a macOS sandbox created from this image gets
when the create omits `disk_mib`. Set for saved macOS sandbox disks;
null for every other image.

